> reduces the amount needed to be disposed of;
> 
> **use alternatives to plastic; **
> e.g. use paper bags / paper straws instead of plastic ones; 
> wider use of biodegradable plastics; 
> reduces plastic waste;
> 
> **safe / controlled disposal; **
> landfill security;
> 
> **recycling / re-use e.g. plastic bags; **
> reduces the amount entering landfill / reduces waste; 
> financial incentives for recycling plastic;

